                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The Bucket",
                                  "The measuring\nbucket belonged to\na painter before\nit served the",
                                  "pump. It has\nhonest marks\ninside and very\ndishonest\ndecorative roses",
                                  "outside. Dot\nchecked its volume\nagainst the\narchive measure.\nPip",
                                  "suggested naming\nit. Dot replied\nthat BUCKET was\nalready admirably",
                                  "clear."
                                ],
