                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The inspector has\nwritten OPEN, FIT,\nSET, CLOSE, TEST.\nSomething must\nhappen before",
                                        "OPEN, and must\nremain in force\nthrough the\nopen-cover work.\nWhich first action",
                                        "makes this\nsequence safe?\nThis is a planning\ncheck, not a live\nswitch experiment.",
                                        "Rivet will not\nopen the machine\nuntil the written\norder accounts for\nthe lock card."
                                      ],
